graphql/queries-projects.html.body:
projects query

  On this page
  ArgumentsTypeExample





List projects, optionally filtered by lifecycle status.
projects(
  status: ProjectStatus
  limit: Int
): ProjectConnection!

Arguments
projects.status ● ProjectStatus enum 
Limit results to projects in this lifecycle stage.
projects.limit ● Int scalar 
Maximum number of projects to return. Defaults to 20.
Type
ProjectConnection object
A paginated project result set.
Example
query ListActiveProjects($status: ProjectStatus) {
  projects(status: $status) {
    totalCount
    nodes {
      id
      name
      status
      owner {
        name
      }
    }
  }
}

graphql/queries-search.html.body:
search query

  On this page
  ArgumentsTypeExample





Search folders, projects, and users from a single endpoint.
search(
  query: String!
): [SearchResult!]!

Arguments
search.query ● String! non-null scalar 
Text matched against folder, project, and user names.
Type
SearchResult union
A result returned from global workspace search.
Example
query SearchWorkspace($query: String!) {
  search(query: $query) {
    __typename
    ... on Folder {
      id
      name
    }
    ... on Project {
      id
      name
      status
    }
    ... on User {
      id
      name
      email
    }
  }
}

